That's completely fine. Those are convenience options—you can add them afterward.
Option 1 (what I'd do)
Just create the two files manually in the repository folder.
.gitignore
Create a file called:
.gitignore
For an R project, something like this is a good start:
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user/

*.html
*.pdf

.DS_Store
